WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:03.000
Hi, H2H families, it's Doctor Perak here.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.064
First, I just want to say
thank you for coming through

3
00:00:06.064 --> 00:00:10.655
as always with your surveys and thank
you for all the amazing ideas last

4
00:00:10.655 --> 00:00:14.680
month with the question about what
we should be asking, but we're not.

5
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:18.472
We're still working through all the many
great ideas that you gave us so that we

6
00:00:18.472 --> 00:00:19.920
can see what we can do with them.

7
00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:20.960
So stay tuned.

8
00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:23.920
And then second, I have
some exciting news to share.

9
00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:28.690
You might have actually already seen it,
like on TV or in the news this week, but for

10
00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:32.473
the first time ever, heart doctors,
children's doctors, OB/GYNs,

11
00:00:32.473 --> 00:00:35.488
and high risk pregnancy specialists all

12
00:00:35.488 --> 00:00:40.217
came together and made a shared plan for
heart health in girls and women across

13
00:00:40.217 --> 00:00:41.400
every stage of life.

14
00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.760
It is finally out and I'm so excited.

15
00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.685
So I'm a volunteer for the
American Heart Association,

16
00:00:46.685 --> 00:00:50.600
and I've been helping lead this work for
about the past year and a half or so.

17
00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:55.481
You might even remember that several
months ago I did a vlog about three women

18
00:00:55.481 --> 00:00:57.320
I met who survived heart disease.

19
00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:00.365
So they were part of this
work that we did too,

20
00:01:00.365 --> 00:01:02.120
and they helped to shape all of it.

21
00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:07.995
This means a lot to me as a woman,
as a mom, a sister, a daughter,

22
00:01:07.995 --> 00:01:10.400
and as a doctor and researcher.

23
00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:15.737
I'm just so glad that we now have these
four big national groups saying clearly

24
00:01:15.737 --> 00:01:20.567
that these parts of women's health like
periods, pregnancy and body changes,

25
00:01:20.567 --> 00:01:24.080
perimenopause, all of it is
important for heart health.

26
00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:27.360
And these things deserve
real care instead of stigma.

27
00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.240
And it doesn't stop at
hormones either, by the way.

28
00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:34.406
So this work also says clearly that
the stress we carry, how we feel,

29
00:01:34.406 --> 00:01:37.918
all the roles that we juggle
are part of heart health too,

30
00:01:37.918 --> 00:01:40.240
and they change across our whole lives.

31
00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:44.769
So to me, this is a win
for us at H2H and what our

32
00:01:44.769 --> 00:01:46.560
H2H community is doing.

33
00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:51.758
The things that we're looking at in H2H
that you know of, like sleep, support,

34
00:01:51.758 --> 00:01:54.082
stress, these things are now being named

35
00:01:54.082 --> 00:01:57.880
officially as part of heart health
and whole health among females.

36
00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:03.441
And every month what you're sharing in
your surveys is building more science

37
00:02:03.441 --> 00:02:08.285
that can feed into future guidelines
that will help benefit women and families

38
00:02:08.285 --> 00:02:08.960
everywhere.

39
00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:12.320
So dads and co-parents, I'm
certainly not leaving you out.

40
00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:13.960
H2H is here for you too.

41
00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:17.720
If you want to learn more about this,
you can check out some of the links below.

42
00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:22.292
And then thank you for sharing new ideas
this month about how to connect with

43
00:02:22.292 --> 00:02:23.280
other H2H families.

44
00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:27.006
If you didn't get a chance to answer
about that on your November survey,

45
00:02:27.006 --> 00:02:29.760
you can drop your thoughts in
the feedback box just below.

46
00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:32.120
Thank you again, and
we'll see you next month.
